(window.TKA_DATA=window.TKA_DATA||{})["bank-matlanjut"]={"id":"matlanjut","name":"Matematika Tingkat Lanjut","count":138,"items":[{"id":"0.0.0","topic":"Matriks","sub":"1.1 Ordo, Transpose & Kesamaan Matriks","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika matriks P berordo 3×2, maka ordo dari matriks P<sup>T</sup> adalah…","options":["2×2","3×3","3×2","2×3"],"key":[3],"why":"Transpose menukar baris dan kolom: matriks 3 baris 2 kolom menjadi 2 baris 3 kolom.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"0.0.1","topic":"Matriks","sub":"1.1 Ordo, Transpose & Kesamaan Matriks","kind":"pg","stem":"Diketahui <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>a+2</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>−1</td><td>2b</td></tr></table></span> = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>5</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>−1</td><td>a−1</td></tr></table></span>. Nilai a + b adalah…","options":["5","3","4","6"],"key":[2],"why":"Dari a + 2 = 5 diperoleh a = 3. Substitusi ke 2b = a − 1 = 2 ⇒ b = 1. Maka a + b = 4.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"0.0.2","topic":"Matriks","sub":"1.1 Ordo, Transpose & Kesamaan Matriks","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika matriks M = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>3</td><td>x−2</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>−1</td></tr></table></span> memenuhi M<sup>T</sup> = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>3</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>−1</td></tr></table></span>, maka nilai x adalah…","options":["3","5","7","9"],"key":[2],"why":"Elemen baris 1 kolom 2 pada M menjadi baris 2 kolom 1 pada M<sup>T</sup>: x − 2 = 5 ⇒ x = 7.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"0.0.3","topic":"Matriks","sub":"1.1 Ordo, Transpose & Kesamaan Matriks","kind":"pg","stem":"Diketahui matriks A = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>2</td><td>−1</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>0</td><td>5</td><td>−3</td></tr></table></span>.Nilai dari a₁₃ + (A<sup>T</sup>)₂₁ adalah…","options":["3","4","1","9"],"key":[0],"why":"a₁₃ (baris 1 kolom 3) = 4, dan (A<sup>T</sup>)₂₁ = a₁₂ = −1. Maka 4 + (−1) = 3.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"0.1.0","topic":"Matriks","sub":"1.2 Penjumlahan, Pengurangan & Perkalian Skalar","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika A adalah matriks 2×2 dengan det(A) = 5, maka nilai det(3A) adalah…","options":["45","25","15","135"],"key":[0],"why":"Untuk matriks berordo n×n berlaku det(kA) = k<sup>n</sup> det(A). Karena n = 2, maka det(3A) = 3² × 5 = 9 × 5 = 45.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"0.1.1","topic":"Matriks","sub":"1.2 Penjumlahan, Pengurangan & Perkalian Skalar","kind":"pg","stem":"Diketahui A = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>3</td><td>−2</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>4</td></tr></table></span> dan B = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>1</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>−3</td><td>0</td></tr></table></span>. Hasil dari 2A − B adalah…","options":["<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>5</td><td>−2</td></tr><tr><td>−1</td><td>8</td></tr></table></span>","<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>7</td><td>−6</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>8</td></tr></table></span>","<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>5</td><td>−6</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>8</td></tr></table></span>","<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>2</td><td>−4</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>4</td></tr></table></span>"],"key":[2],"why":"2A = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>6</td><td>−4</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>8</td></tr></table></span>. Kurangi dengan B: <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>6−1</td><td>−4−2</td></tr><tr><td>2−(−3)</td><td>8−0</td></tr></table></span> = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>5</td><td>−6</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>8</td></tr></table></span>.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"0.1.2","topic":"Matriks","sub":"1.2 Penjumlahan, Pengurangan & Perkalian Skalar","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika P = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>2</td><td>−1</td></tr><tr><td>0</td><td>3</td></tr></table></span> dan Q = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>−4</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>0</td></tr></table></span>, maka matriks <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">1</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span>Q + P adalah…","options":["<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>−2</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>3</td></tr></table></span>","<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>0</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>3</td></tr></table></span>","<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>0</td><td>−2</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>3</td></tr></table></span>","<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>4</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>3</td></tr></table></span>"],"key":[1],"why":"<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">1</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span>Q = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>−2</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>0</td></tr></table></span>. Jumlahkan dengan P: <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>−2+2</td><td>1+(−1)</td></tr><tr><td>3+0</td><td>0+3</td></tr></table></span> = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>0</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>3</td></tr></table></span>.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"0.1.3","topic":"Matriks","sub":"1.2 Penjumlahan, Pengurangan & Perkalian Skalar","kind":"pg","stem":"Diketahui matriks K berordo 3×3 dengan det(K) = −2. Nilai dari det(−2K) adalah…","options":["−8","4","−16","16"],"key":[3],"why":"Untuk ordo 3×3 berlaku det(kK) = k³·det(K) = (−2)³ × (−2) = (−8) × (−2) = 16.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"0.2.0","topic":"Matriks","sub":"1.3 Perkalian Dua Matriks & Pemodelan TKA","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika matriks A berordo 3×4 dan matriks B berordo 4×2, maka hasil kali AB berordo…","options":["2×3","3×2","tidak terdefinisi","4×4"],"key":[1],"why":"Kolom A (4) sama dengan baris B (4), sehingga AB terdefinisi dan berordo baris A × kolom B = 3×2.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"0.2.1","topic":"Matriks","sub":"1.3 Perkalian Dua Matriks & Pemodelan TKA","kind":"pg","stem":"Diketahui A = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>1</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>4</td></tr></table></span> dan B = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>2</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>3</td></tr></table></span>. Elemen baris ke-2 kolom ke-1 dari AB adalah…","options":["4","6","10","12"],"key":[2],"why":"Baris ke-2 A adalah [3, 4] dan kolom ke-1 B adalah <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>1</td></tr></table></span>. Hasil kalinya: 3(2) + 4(1) = 10.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"0.2.2","topic":"Matriks","sub":"1.3 Perkalian Dua Matriks & Pemodelan TKA","kind":"pg","stem":"Hasil kali matriks <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>2</td><td>−1</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>0</td></tr></table></span><span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>1</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>−2</td><td>5</td></tr></table></span> adalah…","options":["<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>4</td><td>13</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>12</td></tr></table></span>","<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>0</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>12</td></tr></table></span>","<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>2</td><td>−4</td></tr><tr><td>−6</td><td>0</td></tr></table></span>","<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>4</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>12</td></tr></table></span>"],"key":[3],"why":"Baris 1: (2+2, 8−5) = (4, 3). Baris 2: (3+0, 12+0) = (3, 12). Jadi <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>4</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>12</td></tr></table></span>.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"0.2.3","topic":"Matriks","sub":"1.3 Perkalian Dua Matriks & Pemodelan TKA","kind":"pg","stem":"Toko buku menjual paket A berisi <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>3</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>4</td></tr></table></span> (buku tulis & pena di cabang 1 dan 2) dengan harga satuan <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>5.000</td></tr><tr><td>3.000</td></tr></table></span>. Pendapatan cabang 1 dan 2 adalah…","options":["<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>15.000</td></tr><tr><td>12.000</td></tr></table></span>","<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>21.000</td></tr><tr><td>17.000</td></tr></table></span>","<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>25.000</td></tr><tr><td>15.000</td></tr></table></span>","<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>17.000</td></tr><tr><td>21.000</td></tr></table></span>"],"key":[1],"why":"<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>3</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>4</td></tr></table></span><span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>5.000</td></tr><tr><td>3.000</td></tr></table></span> = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>15.000+6.000</td></tr><tr><td>5.000+12.000</td></tr></table></span> = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>21.000</td></tr><tr><td>17.000</td></tr></table></span>.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"0.3.0","topic":"Matriks","sub":"1.4 Determinan Matriks 2×2 & Sifat Determinan","kind":"pg","stem":"Diketahui det(A) = 3 dan det(B) = −4 untuk matriks 2×2. Nilai det(A<sup>T</sup> · B²) adalah…","options":["−36","−12","48","144"],"key":[2],"why":"det(A<sup>T</sup> · B²) = det(A<sup>T</sup>) · (det B)² = 3 × (−4)² = 3 × 16 = 48.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"0.3.1","topic":"Matriks","sub":"1.4 Determinan Matriks 2×2 & Sifat Determinan","kind":"pg","stem":"Nilai x positif agar matriks P = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>x</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>x</td></tr></table></span> memiliki determinan 13 adalah…","options":["7","6","5","8"],"key":[0],"why":"det(P) = x² − 36 = 13 ⇒ x² = 49 ⇒ x = 7 (ambil yang positif).","src":"kuis"},{"id":"0.3.2","topic":"Matriks","sub":"1.4 Determinan Matriks 2×2 & Sifat Determinan","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika A = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>3</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>3</td></tr></table></span>, maka nilai dari det(A<sup>2026</sup>) adalah…","options":["1","2026","0","−1"],"key":[0],"why":"det(A) = 3(3) − 2(4) = 9 − 8 = 1. Maka det(A<sup>2026</sup>) = (det A)<sup>2026</sup> = 1<sup>2026</sup> = 1.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"0.3.3","topic":"Matriks","sub":"1.4 Determinan Matriks 2×2 & Sifat Determinan","kind":"pg","stem":"Diketahui matriks 2×2 memenuhi det(A) = 4 dan det(B) = 6. Nilai dari det(2A · B<sup>−1</sup>) adalah…","options":["6","<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">2</span><span class=\"de\">3</span></span>","<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">4</span><span class=\"de\">3</span></span>","<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">8</span><span class=\"de\">3</span></span>"],"key":[3],"why":"det(2A · B<sup>−1</sup>) = 2² · <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">det(A)</span><span class=\"de\">det(B)</span></span> = 4 × <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">4</span><span class=\"de\">6</span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">16</span><span class=\"de\">6</span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">8</span><span class=\"de\">3</span></span>.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"0.4.0","topic":"Matriks","sub":"1.5 Determinan Matriks 3×3 (Sarrus & Kofaktor)","kind":"pg","stem":"Determinan dari matriks segitiga atas A = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>2</td><td>−5</td><td>7</td></tr><tr><td>0</td><td>−3</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>5</td></tr></table></span> adalah…","options":["30","0","−30","4"],"key":[2],"why":"Determinan matriks segitiga atas sama dengan hasil kali elemen diagonal utamanya: 2 × (−3) × 5 = −30.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"0.4.1","topic":"Matriks","sub":"1.5 Determinan Matriks 3×3 (Sarrus & Kofaktor)","kind":"pg","stem":"Pada matriks 3×3, tanda kofaktor C₂₃ (baris ke-2, kolom ke-3) adalah…","options":["negatif (−)","selalu nol","bergantung determinan","positif (+)"],"key":[0],"why":"Rumus tanda kofaktor adalah (−1)<sup>i+j</sup>. Untuk i = 2, j = 3 diperoleh (−1)<sup>2+3</sup> = (−1)⁵ = −1 (negatif).","src":"kuis"},{"id":"0.4.2","topic":"Matriks","sub":"1.5 Determinan Matriks 3×3 (Sarrus & Kofaktor)","kind":"pg","stem":"Determinan dari matriks <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>1</td><td>2</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>0</td><td>4</td><td>5</td></tr><tr><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>−2</td></tr></table></span> adalah…","options":["−12","8","12","−8"],"key":[3],"why":"Matriks segitiga atas: determinannya adalah hasil kali diagonal utama 1 × 4 × (−2) = −8.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"0.4.3","topic":"Matriks","sub":"1.5 Determinan Matriks 3×3 (Sarrus & Kofaktor)","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika det(<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>2</td><td>1</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>0</td><td>k</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>2</td><td>1</td></tr></table></span>) = 3, maka nilai k adalah…","options":["1","2","3","4"],"key":[2],"why":"Ekspansi baris 1: 2(k − 2) − 1(0 − 1) = 2k − 4 + 1 = 2k − 3 = 3 ⇒ 2k = 6 ⇒ k = 3.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"0.5.0","topic":"Matriks","sub":"1.6 Invers Matriks 2×2 & Matriks Singular","kind":"pg","stem":"Invers dari matriks A = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>5</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>2</td></tr></table></span> adalah…","options":["<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>2</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>5</td></tr></table></span>","<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>−2</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>−5</td></tr></table></span>","<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>5</td><td>−3</td></tr><tr><td>−3</td><td>2</td></tr></table></span>","<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>2</td><td>−3</td></tr><tr><td>−3</td><td>5</td></tr></table></span>"],"key":[3],"why":"det(A) = 5(2) − 3(3) = 1. Tukar diagonal utama (2 dan 5) dan ubah tanda diagonal samping (−3 dan −3): <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>2</td><td>−3</td></tr><tr><td>−3</td><td>5</td></tr></table></span>.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"0.5.1","topic":"Matriks","sub":"1.6 Invers Matriks 2×2 & Matriks Singular","kind":"pg","stem":"Matriks <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>k+1</td><td>6</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>k</td></tr></table></span> tidak memiliki invers (singular) untuk nilai k = …","options":["−4 atau 3","−2 atau 1","4 atau −3","2 atau −1"],"key":[0],"why":"Syarat tidak punya invers (singular): (k+1)k − 12 = 0 ⇒ k² + k − 12 = 0 ⇒ (k + 4)(k − 3) = 0 ⇒ k = −4 atau k = 3.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"0.5.2","topic":"Matriks","sub":"1.6 Invers Matriks 2×2 & Matriks Singular","kind":"pg","stem":"Invers dari matriks diagonal D = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>4</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>0</td><td>−<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">1</span><span class=\"de\">3</span></span></td></tr></table></span> adalah…","options":["<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>−<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">1</span><span class=\"de\">3</span></span></td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>0</td><td>4</td></tr></table></span>","<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td><span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">1</span><span class=\"de\">4</span></span></td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>0</td><td>3</td></tr></table></span>","<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>−4</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>0</td><td>3</td></tr></table></span>","<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td><span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">1</span><span class=\"de\">4</span></span></td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>0</td><td>−3</td></tr></table></span>"],"key":[3],"why":"Balik masing-masing elemen diagonal utama: <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">1</span><span class=\"de\">4</span></span> dan −3, sehingga diperoleh <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td><span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">1</span><span class=\"de\">4</span></span></td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>0</td><td>−3</td></tr></table></span>.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"0.5.3","topic":"Matriks","sub":"1.6 Invers Matriks 2×2 & Matriks Singular","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika A = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>2</td><td>−3</td></tr><tr><td>−1</td><td>2</td></tr></table></span>, maka jumlah seluruh elemen pada matriks A⁻¹ adalah…","options":["10","5","8","1"],"key":[2],"why":"det(A) = 4 − 3 = 1, sehingga A⁻¹ = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>2</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>2</td></tr></table></span>. Jumlah seluruh elemennya = 2 + 3 + 1 + 2 = 8.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"0.6.0","topic":"Matriks","sub":"1.7 Invers 3×3, Persamaan AX = B & Pemodelan SPL","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika matriks A dan B berordo 2×2 serta memenuhi persamaan XA = B, maka matriks X adalah…","options":["AB⁻¹","A⁻¹B","B⁻¹A","BA⁻¹"],"key":[3],"why":"Kalikan kedua ruas dengan A⁻¹ dari sebelah kanan: (XA)A⁻¹ = BA⁻¹ ⇒ X·I = BA⁻¹ ⇒ X = BA⁻¹.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"0.6.1","topic":"Matriks","sub":"1.7 Invers 3×3, Persamaan AX = B & Pemodelan SPL","kind":"pg","stem":"Diketahui <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>3</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>2</td></tr></table></span><span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>x</td></tr><tr><td>y</td></tr></table></span> = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>7</td></tr><tr><td>12</td></tr></table></span>. Nilai x − y adalah…","options":["1","0","3","−1"],"key":[0],"why":"det(A) = 6 − 5 = 1. <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>x</td></tr><tr><td>y</td></tr></table></span> = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>2</td><td>−1</td></tr><tr><td>−5</td><td>3</td></tr></table></span><span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>7</td></tr><tr><td>12</td></tr></table></span> = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>14−12</td></tr><tr><td>−35+36</td></tr></table></span> = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>1</td></tr></table></span>. Maka x − y = 2 − 1 = 1.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"0.6.2","topic":"Matriks","sub":"1.7 Invers 3×3, Persamaan AX = B & Pemodelan SPL","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>2</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>2</td></tr></table></span> X = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>5</td></tr><tr><td>8</td></tr></table></span>, maka matriks X adalah…","options":["<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>−2</td></tr><tr><td>1</td></tr></table></span>","<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>1</td></tr></table></span>","<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>−1</td></tr></table></span>","<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>2</td></tr></table></span>"],"key":[1],"why":"det(A) = 4 − 3 = 1 ⇒ A⁻¹ = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>2</td><td>−1</td></tr><tr><td>−3</td><td>2</td></tr></table></span>. Maka X = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>2</td><td>−1</td></tr><tr><td>−3</td><td>2</td></tr></table></span><span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>5</td></tr><tr><td>8</td></tr></table></span> = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>10−8</td></tr><tr><td>−15+16</td></tr></table></span> = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>1</td></tr></table></span>.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"0.6.3","topic":"Matriks","sub":"1.7 Invers 3×3, Persamaan AX = B & Pemodelan SPL","kind":"pg","stem":"Pada sistem persamaan matriks <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>4</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>5</td></tr></table></span><span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>x</td></tr><tr><td>y</td></tr></table></span> = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>18</td></tr><tr><td>16</td></tr></table></span>, nilai determinan utama D dan D<sub>x</sub> menurut aturan Cramer adalah…","options":["D = 14 dan D<sub>x</sub> = 42","D = 14 dan D<sub>x</sub> = 14","D = 14 dan D<sub>x</sub> = 28","D = 26 dan D<sub>x</sub> = 42"],"key":[0],"why":"D = 4(5) − 3(2) = 14. D<sub>x</sub> = det(<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>18</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>16</td><td>5</td></tr></table></span>) = 90 − 48 = 42 (sehingga x = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">42</span><span class=\"de\">14</span></span> = 3).","src":"kuis"},{"id":"1.0.0","topic":"Polinomial","sub":"2.1 Konsep, Derajat & Operasi Polinomial (Orde ≤ 4)","kind":"pg","stem":"Manakah di bawah ini yang merupakan polinomial berderajat 4?","options":["2x⁴ − 7x³ + √5 x − 1","(x² + 1)(x³ − 1)","x⁴ − 5x² + √x − 1","x⁴ − 3x² + <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">2</span><span class=\"de\">x</span></span>"],"key":[0],"why":"Polinomial hanya boleh memuat pangkat x berupa bilangan cacah. Koefisien √5 boleh berbentuk akar selama x tidak berada di dalam akar atau penyebut.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"1.0.1","topic":"Polinomial","sub":"2.1 Konsep, Derajat & Operasi Polinomial (Orde ≤ 4)","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika (ax + 2)(x² − bx + 3) ≡ 2x³ − 4x² + 2x + 6, maka nilai a + b adalah…","options":["6","4","3","5"],"key":[3],"why":"Samakan koefisien x³: a = 2. Samakan koefisien x²: −ab + 2 = −4 ⇒ −2b = −6 ⇒ b = 3. Jadi a + b = 5.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"1.0.2","topic":"Polinomial","sub":"2.1 Konsep, Derajat & Operasi Polinomial (Orde ≤ 4)","kind":"pg","stem":"Koefisien x³ pada hasil kali (x² − 2x + 3)(2x² + x − 1) adalah…","options":["−3","−5","5","3"],"key":[0],"why":"Suku x³ berasal dari (x²)(x) + (−2x)(2x²) = 1x³ − 4x³ = −3x³. Jadi koefisiennya −3.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"1.0.3","topic":"Polinomial","sub":"2.1 Konsep, Derajat & Operasi Polinomial (Orde ≤ 4)","kind":"pg","stem":"Jumlah seluruh koefisien dari polinomial P(x) = (3x³ − 4x + 2)⁴ adalah…","options":["81","1","8","16"],"key":[1],"why":"Jumlah seluruh koefisien dicari dengan mensubstitusikan x = 1: P(1) = (3 − 4 + 2)⁴ = 1⁴ = 1.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"1.1.0","topic":"Polinomial","sub":"2.2 Nilai Polinomial: Substitusi & Skema Horner","kind":"pg","stem":"Nilai polinomial P(x) = x⁴ − 3x² + 2x − 5 untuk x = 2 adalah…","options":["7","1","5","3"],"key":[3],"why":"P(2) = 16 − 3(4) + 4 − 5 = 16 − 12 + 4 − 5 = 3. Jika memakai Horner, wajib tulis koefisien [1, 0, −3, 2, −5].","src":"kuis"},{"id":"1.1.1","topic":"Polinomial","sub":"2.2 Nilai Polinomial: Substitusi & Skema Horner","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika P(x) = 2x³ + ax² − 3x + 1 memenuhi P(−1) = 6, maka nilai a adalah…","options":["3","2","5","4"],"key":[3],"why":"P(−1) = 2(−1) + a(1) − 3(−1) + 1 = −2 + a + 3 + 1 = a + 2 = 6 ⇒ a = 4.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"1.1.2","topic":"Polinomial","sub":"2.2 Nilai Polinomial: Substitusi & Skema Horner","kind":"pg","stem":"Pada skema Horner untuk menghitung P(3) dari P(x) = 2x⁴ − 5x² + x − 7, baris koefisien paling atas yang benar adalah…","options":["[0, 2, −5, 1, −7]","[2, 0, −5, 1, −7]","[2, −5, 0, 1, −7]","[2, −5, 1, −7]"],"key":[1],"why":"Suku x³ tidak tertulis sehingga koefisiennya wajib ditulis 0: [2, 0, −5, 1, −7].","src":"kuis"},{"id":"1.1.3","topic":"Polinomial","sub":"2.2 Nilai Polinomial: Substitusi & Skema Horner","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika P(x) = x³ − 4x² + 5x − 2, maka nilai P(3) − P(1) adalah…","options":["6","8","2","4"],"key":[3],"why":"P(3) = 27 − 36 + 15 − 2 = 4, dan P(1) = 1 − 4 + 5 − 2 = 0. Maka P(3) − P(1) = 4.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"1.2.0","topic":"Polinomial","sub":"2.3 Pembagian Polinomial: Linear & Kuadrat","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika polinomial berderajat 4 dibagi oleh polinomial berderajat 2, maka derajat hasil bagi dan derajat maksimum sisanya berturut-turut adalah…","options":["2 dan 1","2 dan 2","2 dan 0","3 dan 1"],"key":[0],"why":"Derajat hasil bagi = 4 − 2 = 2; derajat sisa maksimum = derajat pembagi − 1 = 2 − 1 = 1.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"1.2.1","topic":"Polinomial","sub":"2.3 Pembagian Polinomial: Linear & Kuadrat","kind":"pg","stem":"Hasil bagi pembagian 3x³ − 7x² + 5x − 2 oleh (3x − 1) adalah…","options":["x² − 2x + 1","3x² − 6x + 3","x² − 6x + 3","3x² − 2x + 1"],"key":[0],"why":"Dengan k = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">1</span><span class=\"de\">3</span></span> pada [3, −7, 5, −2] diperoleh koefisien Horner [3, −6, 3]. Bagi dengan a = 3: H(x) = x² − 2x + 1.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"1.2.2","topic":"Polinomial","sub":"2.3 Pembagian Polinomial: Linear & Kuadrat","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika P(x) = 4x³ − 2x² + 6x − 1 dibagi oleh (2x + 1) menghasilkan hasil bagi H(x), maka koefisien x² pada H(x) adalah…","options":["−2","4","1","2"],"key":[3],"why":"Koefisien utama hasil bagi adalah <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">4</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span> = 2.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"1.2.3","topic":"Polinomial","sub":"2.3 Pembagian Polinomial: Linear & Kuadrat","kind":"pg","stem":"Sisa pembagian x³ + 2x² − 5x + 3 oleh (x² − 1) adalah…","options":["4x − 5","−4x + 5","−4x + 1","2x + 3"],"key":[1],"why":"Untuk x² − 1 = 0 berlaku x² ≡ 1. Maka x(1) + 2(1) − 5x + 3 = −4x + 5.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"1.3.0","topic":"Polinomial","sub":"2.4 Teorema Sisa (Suku Sisa Pembagian)","kind":"pg","stem":"Suku banyak f(x) = x⁴ + ax³ + bx² + x − 6 dibagi oleh (x² + x + 1) bersisa (5x − 1). Nilai a − b adalah…","options":["5","2","3","4"],"key":[0],"why":"Untuk pembagi x² + x + 1 = 0 berlaku x³ ≡ 1 dan x² ≡ −x − 1. Substitusi ke f(x): x(1) + a(1) + b(−x − 1) + x − 6 = (2 − b)x + (a − b − 6) ≡ 5x − 1. Maka 2 − b = 5 ⇒ b = −3 dan a − (−3) − 6 = −1 ⇒ a = 2, sehingga a − b = 2 − (−3) = 5.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"1.3.1","topic":"Polinomial","sub":"2.4 Teorema Sisa (Suku Sisa Pembagian)","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika P(x) dibagi (x − 2) bersisa 5 dan dibagi (x − 3) bersisa 8, maka sisa P(x) dibagi (x² − 5x + 6) adalah…","options":["2x + 1","x + 3","3x + 1","3x − 1"],"key":[3],"why":"S(2) = 2p + q = 5 dan S(3) = 3p + q = 8. Kurangkan: p = 3, lalu q = 5 − 6 = −1. Jadi S(x) = 3x − 1.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"1.3.2","topic":"Polinomial","sub":"2.4 Teorema Sisa (Suku Sisa Pembagian)","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika P(x) dibagi (x + 1) bersisa −3 dan dibagi (x − 3) bersisa 5, maka sisa P(x) dibagi (x² − 2x − 3) adalah…","options":["2x + 1","3x − 4","x − 2","2x − 1"],"key":[3],"why":"S(−1) = −p + q = −3 dan S(3) = 3p + q = 5. Kurangkan: 4p = 8 ⇒ p = 2, q = −1 ⇒ S(x) = 2x − 1.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"1.3.3","topic":"Polinomial","sub":"2.4 Teorema Sisa (Suku Sisa Pembagian)","kind":"pg","stem":"Sisa pembagian P(x) = x⁴ − 2x³ + 4x − 5 oleh (x − 2) adalah…","options":["11","19","3","−5"],"key":[2],"why":"S = P(2) = 16 − 16 + 8 − 5 = 3.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"1.4.0","topic":"Polinomial","sub":"2.5 Teorema Faktor & Pemfaktoran Orde ≤ 4","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika (x − 2) adalah faktor dari P(x) = x³ − kx² + x + 6, maka nilai k adalah…","options":["3","4","5","2"],"key":[1],"why":"Karena (x − 2) faktor, maka P(2) = 0 ⇒ 8 − 4k + 2 + 6 = 0 ⇒ 4k = 16 ⇒ k = 4.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"1.4.1","topic":"Polinomial","sub":"2.5 Teorema Faktor & Pemfaktoran Orde ≤ 4","kind":"pg","stem":"Salah satu faktor linear dari P(x) = x⁴ − 5x² + 4 adalah…","options":["x − 3","x + 4","x − 4","x + 2"],"key":[3],"why":"Faktorkan sebagai kuadrat dalam x²: (x² − 1)(x² − 4) = (x − 1)(x + 1)(x − 2)(x + 2). Jadi (x + 2) adalah faktor.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"1.4.2","topic":"Polinomial","sub":"2.5 Teorema Faktor & Pemfaktoran Orde ≤ 4","kind":"pg","stem":"Jumlah semua koefisien P(x) = x³ − 5x² + 3x + 1 sama dengan 0. Faktor linear yang pasti dimiliki P(x) adalah…","options":["x + 1","x − 1","x + 3","x − 5"],"key":[1],"why":"Jika jumlah semua koefisien P(1) = 0, maka x = 1 adalah akar dan (x − 1) pasti faktornya.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"1.4.3","topic":"Polinomial","sub":"2.5 Teorema Faktor & Pemfaktoran Orde ≤ 4","kind":"pg","stem":"Banyak titik potong grafik f(x) = (x − 1)(x + 2)² terhadap sumbu-X adalah…","options":["4 titik","3 titik","1 titik","2 titik"],"key":[3],"why":"Akar-akar realnya adalah x = 1 (memotong) dan x = −2 (menyinggung), sehingga terdapat 2 titik potong: (1, 0) dan (−2, 0).","src":"kuis"},{"id":"1.5.0","topic":"Polinomial","sub":"2.6 Akar-Akar Polinomial & Teorema Vieta","kind":"pg","stem":"Hasil kali semua akar persamaan 2x⁴ − 6x³ + 5x − 10 = 0 adalah…","options":["−3","−5","5","3"],"key":[1],"why":"Untuk derajat 4 (ax⁴+bx³+cx²+dx+e=0), hasil kali keempat akar adalah +<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">e</span><span class=\"de\">a</span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">−10</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span> = −5.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"1.5.1","topic":"Polinomial","sub":"2.6 Akar-Akar Polinomial & Teorema Vieta","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika salah satu akar x³ − 6x² + kx − 6 = 0 adalah kebalikan dari akar lainnya (x₁ · x₂ = 1), maka akar ketiganya adalah…","options":["6","3","1","2"],"key":[0],"why":"Dari Vieta, x₁ · x₂ · x₃ = −<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">d</span><span class=\"de\">a</span></span> = −<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">−6</span><span class=\"de\">1</span></span> = 6. Karena x₁ · x₂ = 1, maka 1 · x₃ = 6 ⇒ x₃ = 6.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"1.5.2","topic":"Polinomial","sub":"2.6 Akar-Akar Polinomial & Teorema Vieta","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika akar-akar persamaan x³ − 9x² + kx − 27 = 0 membentuk barisan geometri, maka salah satu akarnya pasti bernilai…","options":["9","1","6","3"],"key":[3],"why":"Untuk barisan geometri berlaku x₂³ = x₁·x₂·x₃ = −<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">d</span><span class=\"de\">a</span></span> = 27 ⇒ x₂ = 3.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"1.5.3","topic":"Polinomial","sub":"2.6 Akar-Akar Polinomial & Teorema Vieta","kind":"pg","stem":"Pada persamaan x⁴ − 3x³ + 2x² − 8 = 0, jumlah hasil kali dua-dua akarnya (Σ x<sub>i</sub> x<sub>j</sub>) adalah…","options":["0","−3","2","−8"],"key":[2],"why":"Rumus Σ x<sub>i</sub> x<sub>j</sub> = +<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">c</span><span class=\"de\">a</span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">2</span><span class=\"de\">1</span></span> = 2.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"2.0.0","topic":"Fungsi Lanjut","sub":"3.1 Fungsi Polinom (Orde ≤ 4): Domain, Range & Grafik","kind":"pg","stem":"Daerah hasil (range) dari fungsi f(x) = −(x − 1)⁴ + 5 untuk x ∈ ℝ adalah…","options":["R<sub>f</sub> = [1, 5]","R<sub>f</sub> = [5, ∞)","R<sub>f</sub> = ℝ","R<sub>f</sub> = (−∞, 5]"],"key":[3],"why":"Karena (x − 1)⁴ ≥ 0, maka −(x − 1)⁴ ≤ 0 sehingga nilai maksimumnya adalah 5: R<sub>f</sub> = (−∞, 5].","src":"kuis"},{"id":"2.0.1","topic":"Fungsi Lanjut","sub":"3.1 Fungsi Polinom (Orde ≤ 4): Domain, Range & Grafik","kind":"pg","stem":"Manakah fungsi berikut yang memiliki daerah hasil seluruh bilangan real ℝ?","options":["f(x) = x⁴ + 1","f(x) = x² − 4","f(x) = x³ − 3x + 1","f(x) = |x − 2|"],"key":[2],"why":"Fungsi polinomial berderajat ganjil (derajat 3) membentang dari −∞ hingga +∞ sehingga R<sub>f</sub> = ℝ.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"2.0.2","topic":"Fungsi Lanjut","sub":"3.1 Fungsi Polinom (Orde ≤ 4): Domain, Range & Grafik","kind":"pg","stem":"Titik potong grafik fungsi polinomial f(x) = 2x⁴ − 5x³ + x − 8 terhadap sumbu-Y adalah…","options":["(0, 2)","(1, −10)","(0, −8)","(−8, 0)"],"key":[2],"why":"Titik potong sumbu-Y diperoleh saat x = 0: f(0) = −8, yaitu titik (0, −8).","src":"kuis"},{"id":"2.0.3","topic":"Fungsi Lanjut","sub":"3.1 Fungsi Polinom (Orde ≤ 4): Domain, Range & Grafik","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika f(x) = x³ + 2 untuk domain terbatas D<sub>f</sub> = [−1, 2], maka daerah hasilnya adalah…","options":["ℝ","[1, 10]","[−1, 8]","[0, 10]"],"key":[1],"why":"Karena x³ + 2 monoton naik, substitusikan ujung selang: f(−1) = 1 dan f(2) = 10 ⇒ R<sub>f</sub> = [1, 10].","src":"kuis"},{"id":"2.1.0","topic":"Fungsi Lanjut","sub":"3.2 Fungsi Rasional: Domain, Asimtot & Range","kind":"pg","stem":"Asimtot datar dari grafik fungsi f(x) = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">6 − 3x</span><span class=\"de\">2x + 4</span></span> adalah…","options":["y = 3","y = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">3</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span>","y = −<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">3</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span>","y = −2"],"key":[2],"why":"Urutkan suku x terlebih dahulu: f(x) = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">−3x + 6</span><span class=\"de\">2x + 4</span></span>. Rasio koefisien x adalah <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">a</span><span class=\"de\">c</span></span> = −<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">3</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span>.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"2.1.1","topic":"Fungsi Lanjut","sub":"3.2 Fungsi Rasional: Domain, Asimtot & Range","kind":"pg","stem":"Domain alami dari fungsi f(x) = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">x + 1</span><span class=\"de\">x² − 9</span></span> adalah…","options":["x > 3","x ≠ 3","x ≠ −1","x ≠ ±3"],"key":[3],"why":"Penyebut x² − 9 ≠ 0 ⇒ (x − 3)(x + 3) ≠ 0 ⇒ x ≠ 3 dan x ≠ −3.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"2.1.2","topic":"Fungsi Lanjut","sub":"3.2 Fungsi Rasional: Domain, Asimtot & Range","kind":"pg","stem":"Invers dari fungsi rasional f(x) = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">3x + 2</span><span class=\"de\">x − 4</span></span> untuk x ≠ 4 adalah f⁻¹(x) = …","options":["<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">−4x + 2</span><span class=\"de\">x + 3</span></span>","<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">4x + 2</span><span class=\"de\">x − 3</span></span>","<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">3x − 4</span><span class=\"de\">x + 2</span></span>","<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">4x − 2</span><span class=\"de\">x − 3</span></span>"],"key":[1],"why":"Tukar koefisien 3 dan −4 sambil mengubah tandanya: f⁻¹(x) = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">4x + 2</span><span class=\"de\">x − 3</span></span>, x ≠ 3.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"2.1.3","topic":"Fungsi Lanjut","sub":"3.2 Fungsi Rasional: Domain, Asimtot & Range","kind":"pg","stem":"Titik potong asimtot tegak dan asimtot datar dari fungsi f(x) = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">4x − 1</span><span class=\"de\">2x + 6</span></span> adalah…","options":["(2, −3)","(3, 2)","(−3, 2)","(−3, −2)"],"key":[2],"why":"Asimtot tegak: 2x + 6 = 0 ⇒ x = −3. Asimtot datar: y = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">4</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span> = 2. Titik potongnya (−3, 2).","src":"kuis"},{"id":"2.2.0","topic":"Fungsi Lanjut","sub":"3.3 Fungsi Akar (Irasional): Domain & Range","kind":"pg","stem":"Domain alami dari fungsi f(x) = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">1</span><span class=\"de\">√(x² − 4)</span></span> adalah…","options":["x ≤ −2 atau x ≥ 2","−2 ≤ x ≤ 2","x > 2","x < −2 atau x > 2"],"key":[3],"why":"Karena akar berada di penyebut, syaratnya positif murni: x² − 4 > 0 ⇒ (x + 2)(x − 2) > 0 ⇒ x < −2 atau x > 2.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"2.2.1","topic":"Fungsi Lanjut","sub":"3.3 Fungsi Akar (Irasional): Domain & Range","kind":"pg","stem":"Daerah hasil (range) dari fungsi f(x) = √(16 − x²) adalah…","options":["[0, 4]","[−4, 4]","[0, 16]","[0, ∞)"],"key":[0],"why":"Di dalam akar maksimum bernilai 16 (saat x = 0) dan minimum 0 (saat x = ±4). Maka √(16 − x²) berada pada selang [0, 4].","src":"kuis"},{"id":"2.2.2","topic":"Fungsi Lanjut","sub":"3.3 Fungsi Akar (Irasional): Domain & Range","kind":"pg","stem":"Daerah hasil (range) dari fungsi f(x) = 4 − √(2x − 6) adalah…","options":["[3, ∞)","(−∞, 4]","(−∞, 3]","[4, ∞)"],"key":[1],"why":"Karena √(2x − 6) ≥ 0, maka −√(2x − 6) ≤ 0 sehingga f(x) ≤ 4. Jadi R<sub>f</sub> = (−∞, 4].","src":"kuis"},{"id":"2.2.3","topic":"Fungsi Lanjut","sub":"3.3 Fungsi Akar (Irasional): Domain & Range","kind":"pg","stem":"Domain alami dari fungsi f(x) = √(<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">x − 1</span><span class=\"de\">x + 3</span></span>) adalah…","options":["x ≥ 1","x ≤ −3 atau x ≥ 1","−3 < x ≤ 1","x < −3 atau x ≥ 1"],"key":[3],"why":"Pembuat nol x = 1 dan x = −3 (penyebut ≠ −3). Uji tanda positif menghasilkan x < −3 atau x ≥ 1.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"2.3.0","topic":"Fungsi Lanjut","sub":"3.4 Fungsi Eksponensial (Basis Bilangan Asli)","kind":"pg","stem":"Daerah hasil dari fungsi f(x) = 5 − 2<sup>x+1</sup> adalah…","options":["[5, ∞)","(−∞, 5)","(−∞, 5]","(5, ∞)"],"key":[1],"why":"Karena 2<sup>x+1</sup> > 0, maka −2<sup>x+1</sup> < 0 sehingga 5 − 2<sup>x+1</sup> < 5. Jadi R<sub>f</sub> = (−∞, 5).","src":"kuis"},{"id":"2.3.1","topic":"Fungsi Lanjut","sub":"3.4 Fungsi Eksponensial (Basis Bilangan Asli)","kind":"pg","stem":"Grafik fungsi f(x) = k · 2<sup>x</sup> + 3 melalui titik (2, 15). Nilai f(0) adalah…","options":["4","7","3","6"],"key":[3],"why":"Substitusi (2, 15): k · 2² + 3 = 15 ⇒ 4k = 12 ⇒ k = 3. Maka f(0) = 3 · 2⁰ + 3 = 3(1) + 3 = 6.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"2.3.2","topic":"Fungsi Lanjut","sub":"3.4 Fungsi Eksponensial (Basis Bilangan Asli)","kind":"pg","stem":"Persamaan asimtot datar dari grafik fungsi f(x) = 2 · 4<sup>x−3</sup> − 7 adalah…","options":["x = 3","y = 2","y = 3","y = −7"],"key":[3],"why":"Karena 2 · 4<sup>x−3</sup> > 0 mendekati 0 saat x → −∞, asimtot datarnya adalah y = −7.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"2.3.3","topic":"Fungsi Lanjut","sub":"3.4 Fungsi Eksponensial (Basis Bilangan Asli)","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika grafik fungsi eksponensial f(x) = a · 3<sup>x</sup> + c memiliki asimtot datar y = 2 dan melalui (0, 5), maka nilai a adalah…","options":["3","7","2","5"],"key":[0],"why":"Asimtot datar memberi c = 2. Saat x = 0: a · 3⁰ + 2 = 5 ⇒ a + 2 = 5 ⇒ a = 3.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"2.4.0","topic":"Fungsi Lanjut","sub":"3.5 Fungsi Logaritma: Domain, Asimtot & Grafik","kind":"pg","stem":"Domain alami dari fungsi f(x) = ²log(x² − 2x − 8) adalah…","options":["−2 < x < 4","x < −2 atau x > 4","x > 4","x ≤ −2 atau x ≥ 4"],"key":[1],"why":"Syarat numerus > 0: x² − 2x − 8 > 0 ⇒ (x + 2)(x − 4) > 0 ⇒ x < −2 atau x > 4.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"2.4.1","topic":"Fungsi Lanjut","sub":"3.5 Fungsi Logaritma: Domain, Asimtot & Grafik","kind":"pg","stem":"Invers dari fungsi f(x) = ²log(x − 3) + 1 adalah f⁻¹(x) = …","options":["2<sup>x−3</sup> + 1","(x − 1)² + 3","2<sup>x+1</sup> − 3","2<sup>x−1</sup> + 3"],"key":[3],"why":"y − 1 = ²log(x − 3) ⇒ x − 3 = 2<sup>y−1</sup> ⇒ x = 2<sup>y−1</sup> + 3. Jadi f⁻¹(x) = 2<sup>x−1</sup> + 3.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"2.4.2","topic":"Fungsi Lanjut","sub":"3.5 Fungsi Logaritma: Domain, Asimtot & Grafik","kind":"pg","stem":"Persamaan asimtot tegak dari grafik fungsi f(x) = ⁵log(3x + 9) − 4 adalah…","options":["y = −4","x = −9","x = −3","x = 3"],"key":[2],"why":"Pembuat nol numerus: 3x + 9 = 0 ⇒ x = −3.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"2.4.3","topic":"Fungsi Lanjut","sub":"3.5 Fungsi Logaritma: Domain, Asimtot & Grafik","kind":"pg","stem":"Titik yang pasti dilalui oleh grafik f(x) = <sup>b</sup> log(x − 4) + 2 untuk setiap basis b > 1 adalah…","options":["(4, 2)","(5, 0)","(5, 2)","(4, 0)"],"key":[2],"why":"Agar <sup>b</sup> log(x − 4) = 0 (tidak bergantung basis b), pilih numerus x − 4 = 1 ⇒ x = 5, menghasilkan y = 2.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"2.5.0","topic":"Fungsi Lanjut","sub":"3.6 Fungsi Nilai Mutlak: Grafik & Daerah Hasil","kind":"pg","stem":"Nilai minimum dari fungsi f(x) = |2x + 4| − 5 adalah…","options":["−2","−4","4","−5"],"key":[3],"why":"Nilai terkecil dari |2x + 4| adalah 0 (saat x = −2), sehingga nilai minimum f(x) adalah 0 − 5 = −5.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"2.5.1","topic":"Fungsi Lanjut","sub":"3.6 Fungsi Nilai Mutlak: Grafik & Daerah Hasil","kind":"pg","stem":"Banyak titik potong grafik y = |x² − 4| dengan garis mendatar y = 3 adalah…","options":["1","2","3","4"],"key":[3],"why":"|x² − 4| = 3 memberikan x² − 4 = 3 (x² = 7 → 2 solusi) atau x² − 4 = −3 (x² = 1 → 2 solusi). Total ada 4 titik potong.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"2.5.2","topic":"Fungsi Lanjut","sub":"3.6 Fungsi Nilai Mutlak: Grafik & Daerah Hasil","kind":"pg","stem":"Persamaan sumbu simetri dari grafik fungsi f(x) = 3|2x + 6| − 4 adalah…","options":["x = −4","x = 3","x = −3","x = −6"],"key":[2],"why":"Samakan isi mutlak dengan nol: 2x + 6 = 0 ⇒ x = −3.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"2.5.3","topic":"Fungsi Lanjut","sub":"3.6 Fungsi Nilai Mutlak: Grafik & Daerah Hasil","kind":"pg","stem":"Himpunan penyelesaian dari |2x − 1| = 5 adalah…","options":["{3}","{−3, 3}","{2, −3}","{−2, 3}"],"key":[3],"why":"2x − 1 = 5 ⇒ x = 3, atau 2x − 1 = −5 ⇒ x = −2. Jadi {−2, 3}.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"2.6.0","topic":"Fungsi Lanjut","sub":"3.7 Fungsi Trigonometri: Amplitudo, Periode & Range","kind":"pg","stem":"Periode dan daerah hasil dari fungsi f(x) = 4 sin(3x) − 1 berturut-turut adalah…","options":["120° dan [−5, 3]","60° dan [−3, 5]","120° dan [−4, 4]","540° dan [−5, 3]"],"key":[0],"why":"Periode T = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">360°</span><span class=\"de\">3</span></span> = 120°. Nilai minimum = −4 − 1 = −5 dan maksimum = 4 − 1 = 3, sehingga R<sub>f</sub> = [−5, 3].","src":"kuis"},{"id":"2.6.1","topic":"Fungsi Lanjut","sub":"3.7 Fungsi Trigonometri: Amplitudo, Periode & Range","kind":"pg","stem":"Nilai maksimum dari f(x) = 3 sin x + 4 cos x + 2 adalah…","options":["5","9","8","7"],"key":[3],"why":"Bentuk a sin x + b cos x memiliki nilai maksimum √(a² + b²) = √(3² + 4²) = 5. Ditambah 2 menghasilkan 5 + 2 = 7.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"2.6.2","topic":"Fungsi Lanjut","sub":"3.7 Fungsi Trigonometri: Amplitudo, Periode & Range","kind":"pg","stem":"Periode dari fungsi f(x) = 2 tan(4x − π) + 1 adalah…","options":["45°","360°","180°","90°"],"key":[0],"why":"Periode fungsi tangen adalah <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">180°</span><span class=\"de\">k</span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">180°</span><span class=\"de\">4</span></span> = 45°.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"2.6.3","topic":"Fungsi Lanjut","sub":"3.7 Fungsi Trigonometri: Amplitudo, Periode & Range","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika fungsi f(x) = a sin(2x) + b memiliki nilai maksimum 8 dan nilai minimum −2 dengan a > 0, maka nilai a + b adalah…","options":["10","8","11","6"],"key":[1],"why":"Amplitudo a = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">8 − (−2)</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span> = 5, dan garis tengah b = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">8 + (−2)</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span> = 3. Maka a + b = 8.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"3.0.0","topic":"Vektor","sub":"4.1 Vektor pada Bidang (R²) & Ruang (R³)","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika titik P(3, −2, 5) dan Q(1, 4, −1), maka vektor PQ dalam basis satuan adalah…","options":["2î − 6ĵ + 6k̂","4î + 2ĵ + 4k̂","−2î + 6ĵ − 6k̂","−2î + 2ĵ − 6k̂"],"key":[2],"why":"PQ = q − p = (1−3, 4−(−2), −1−5) = (−2, 6, −6) = −2î + 6ĵ − 6k̂.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"3.0.1","topic":"Vektor","sub":"4.1 Vektor pada Bidang (R²) & Ruang (R³)","kind":"pg","stem":"Diketahui jajargenjang ABCD dengan A(1, 2), B(4, 3), dan C(5, 6). Koordinat titik D adalah…","options":["(8, 7)","(2, 5)","(3, 5)","(0, 1)"],"key":[1],"why":"Pada jajargenjang berlaku AD = BC ⇒ d − a = c − b ⇒ d = a + c − b = (1+5−4, 2+6−3) = (2, 5).","src":"kuis"},{"id":"3.0.2","topic":"Vektor","sub":"4.1 Vektor pada Bidang (R²) & Ruang (R³)","kind":"pg","stem":"Diketahui vektor posisi a = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>−3</td></tr><tr><td>1</td></tr></table></span> dan b = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>−1</td></tr><tr><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>4</td></tr></table></span>. Vektor 2a − b adalah…","options":["<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>5</td></tr><tr><td>−4</td></tr><tr><td>6</td></tr></table></span>","<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>−8</td></tr><tr><td>−2</td></tr></table></span>","<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>−4</td></tr><tr><td>−2</td></tr></table></span>","<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>5</td></tr><tr><td>−8</td></tr><tr><td>−2</td></tr></table></span>"],"key":[3],"why":"2a − b = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>4 − (−1)</td></tr><tr><td>−6 − 2</td></tr><tr><td>2 − 4</td></tr></table></span> = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>5</td></tr><tr><td>−8</td></tr><tr><td>−2</td></tr></table></span>.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"3.0.3","topic":"Vektor","sub":"4.1 Vektor pada Bidang (R²) & Ruang (R³)","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika AB = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>−1</td></tr><tr><td>2</td></tr></table></span> dan koordinat ujung B(5, 2, −1), maka koordinat pangkal A adalah…","options":["(2, 3, −3)","(−2, −3, 3)","(2, 1, −3)","(8, 1, 1)"],"key":[0],"why":"AB = b − a ⇒ a = b − AB = (5−3, 2−(−1), −1−2) = (2, 3, −3).","src":"kuis"},{"id":"3.1.0","topic":"Vektor","sub":"4.2 Panjang Vektor, Jarak & Vektor Satuan","kind":"pg","stem":"Panjang vektor v = 2î − 3ĵ + 6k̂ adalah…","options":["5","7","49","11"],"key":[1],"why":"|v| = √(2² + (−3)² + 6²) = √(4 + 9 + 36) = √49 = 7.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"3.1.1","topic":"Vektor","sub":"4.2 Panjang Vektor, Jarak & Vektor Satuan","kind":"pg","stem":"Vektor satuan yang searah dengan u = (3, −4, 0) adalah…","options":["(<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">3</span><span class=\"de\">5</span></span>, −<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">4</span><span class=\"de\">5</span></span>, 0)","(<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">3</span><span class=\"de\">7</span></span>, −<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">4</span><span class=\"de\">7</span></span>, 0)","(−<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">3</span><span class=\"de\">5</span></span>, <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">4</span><span class=\"de\">5</span></span>, 0)","(3, −4, 1)"],"key":[0],"why":"|u| = √(9 + 16 + 0) = 5. Bagi setiap komponen dengan 5: (<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">3</span><span class=\"de\">5</span></span>, −<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">4</span><span class=\"de\">5</span></span>, 0).","src":"kuis"},{"id":"3.1.2","topic":"Vektor","sub":"4.2 Panjang Vektor, Jarak & Vektor Satuan","kind":"pg","stem":"Jarak antara titik A(1, −2, 3) dan B(3, 1, −3) adalah…","options":["11","5","9","7"],"key":[3],"why":"|AB| = √((3−1)² + (1−(−2))² + (−3−3)²) = √(4 + 9 + 36) = √49 = 7.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"3.1.3","topic":"Vektor","sub":"4.2 Panjang Vektor, Jarak & Vektor Satuan","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika panjang vektor u = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>p</td></tr><tr><td>−2</td></tr><tr><td>1</td></tr></table></span> sama dengan √14, maka nilai p² adalah…","options":["3","11","5","9"],"key":[3],"why":"p² + (−2)² + 1² = 14 ⇒ p² + 5 = 14 ⇒ p² = 9.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"3.2.0","topic":"Vektor","sub":"4.3 Operasi Vektor, Kolinearitas & Perbandingan Ruas","kind":"pg","stem":"Agar titik A(1, 2, 3), B(3, 5, 7), dan C(7, p, q) segaris (kolinear), maka nilai p + q adalah…","options":["24","20","28","26"],"key":[3],"why":"AB = (2, 3, 4) dan AC = (6, p−2, q−3). Karena segaris, AC = 3·AB = (6, 9, 12). Maka p − 2 = 9 ⇒ p = 11 dan q − 3 = 12 ⇒ q = 15. Jadi p + q = 26.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"3.2.1","topic":"Vektor","sub":"4.3 Operasi Vektor, Kolinearitas & Perbandingan Ruas","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika titik M adalah titik tengah ruas garis AB dengan A(−2, 4, 6) dan B(6, −2, 0), maka koordinat M adalah…","options":["(−4, 3, 3)","(4, 2, 6)","(2, 1, 3)","(2, 2, 3)"],"key":[2],"why":"M = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">A + B</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span> = (<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">−2+6</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span>, <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">4−2</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span>, <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">6+0</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span>) = (2, 1, 3).","src":"kuis"},{"id":"3.2.2","topic":"Vektor","sub":"4.3 Operasi Vektor, Kolinearitas & Perbandingan Ruas","kind":"pg","stem":"Vektor u = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>−6</td></tr><tr><td>2</td></tr></table></span> sejajar (kolinear) dengan vektor…","options":["<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>6</td></tr><tr><td>−2</td></tr></table></span>","<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>1</td></tr></table></span>","<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>−2</td></tr><tr><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>−1</td></tr></table></span>","<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>−2</td></tr><tr><td>−3</td></tr><tr><td>1</td></tr></table></span>"],"key":[2],"why":"Karena <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>−6</td></tr><tr><td>2</td></tr></table></span> = −2 × <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>−2</td></tr><tr><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>−1</td></tr></table></span>, keduanya kelipatan skalar dan sejajar.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"3.2.3","topic":"Vektor","sub":"4.3 Operasi Vektor, Kolinearitas & Perbandingan Ruas","kind":"pg","stem":"Pada segitiga ABC, jika titik D adalah titik tengah BC, maka vektor AD sama dengan…","options":["AB − AC","<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">1</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span>(AB − AC)","AB + AC","<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">1</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span>(AB + AC)"],"key":[3],"why":"Dari aturan jajargenjang, diagonal ke titik tengah sisi depan adalah rata-rata kedua sisi apitnya: AD = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">1</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span>(AB + AC).","src":"kuis"},{"id":"3.3.0","topic":"Vektor","sub":"4.4 Hasil Kali Titik (Dot Product) & Sudut Antarvektor","kind":"pg","stem":"Nilai p agar vektor u = (2, p, −4) dan v = (3, 2, 2) saling tegak lurus adalah…","options":["4","−1","2","1"],"key":[3],"why":"Syarat tegak lurus adalah u · v = 0 ⇒ 2(3) + p(2) + (−4)(2) = 0 ⇒ 6 + 2p − 8 = 0 ⇒ 2p = 2 ⇒ p = 1.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"3.3.1","topic":"Vektor","sub":"4.4 Hasil Kali Titik (Dot Product) & Sudut Antarvektor","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika |u| = 3, |v| = 4, dan |u + v| = 5, maka besar sudut antara vektor u dan v adalah…","options":["0°","60°","90°","45°"],"key":[2],"why":"|u + v|² = |u|² + |v|² + 2u·v ⇒ 25 = 9 + 16 + 2u·v ⇒ u·v = 0. Karena u·v = 0, sudutnya 90°.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"3.3.2","topic":"Vektor","sub":"4.4 Hasil Kali Titik (Dot Product) & Sudut Antarvektor","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika |a| = 2, |b| = 3, dan sudut antara a dan b adalah 120°, maka nilai dari a · (a + b) adalah…","options":["7","10","1","4"],"key":[2],"why":"a · (a + b) = |a|² + a · b = 2² + (2)(3)cos 120° = 4 + 6(−<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">1</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span>) = 4 − 3 = 1.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"3.3.3","topic":"Vektor","sub":"4.4 Hasil Kali Titik (Dot Product) & Sudut Antarvektor","kind":"pg","stem":"Diketahui |u + v| = |u − v| untuk vektor tak-nol u dan v. Besar sudut antara u dan v adalah…","options":["90°","0°","60°","45°"],"key":[0],"why":"Kuadratkan kedua ruas: |u|² + |v|² + 2u·v = |u|² + |v|² − 2u·v ⇒ 4(u·v) = 0 ⇒ u ⊥ v (90°).","src":"kuis"},{"id":"3.4.0","topic":"Vektor","sub":"4.5 Proyeksi Skalar & Proyeksi Vektor Ortogonal","kind":"pg","stem":"Panjang proyeksi vektor a = (1, −2, 2) pada vektor b = (2, 1, −2) adalah…","options":["2","4","<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">4</span><span class=\"de\">3</span></span>","<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">2</span><span class=\"de\">3</span></span>"],"key":[2],"why":"a · b = 1(2) + (−2)(1) + 2(−2) = −4. |b| = √(4 + 1 + 4) = 3. Panjang proyeksi = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">|a · b|</span><span class=\"de\">|b|</span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">|−4|</span><span class=\"de\">3</span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">4</span><span class=\"de\">3</span></span>.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"3.4.1","topic":"Vektor","sub":"4.5 Proyeksi Skalar & Proyeksi Vektor Ortogonal","kind":"pg","stem":"Proyeksi vektor u = (6, 2) pada vektor v = (1, 2) adalah…","options":["(1, 2)","(2, 4)","(3, 6)","(4, 2)"],"key":[1],"why":"u · v = 6 + 4 = 10, dan |v|² = 1² + 2² = 5. Maka p = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">10</span><span class=\"de\">5</span></span>(1, 2) = 2(1, 2) = (2, 4).","src":"kuis"},{"id":"3.4.2","topic":"Vektor","sub":"4.5 Proyeksi Skalar & Proyeksi Vektor Ortogonal","kind":"pg","stem":"Proyeksi skalar ortogonal u = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>−3</td></tr><tr><td>4</td></tr></table></span> pada v = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>3</td></tr></table></span> adalah…","options":["1","0","<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">24</span><span class=\"de\">5</span></span>","5"],"key":[1],"why":"u · v = (−3)(4) + 4(3) = −12 + 12 = 0. Karena tegak lurus, proyeksi skalarnya 0.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"3.4.3","topic":"Vektor","sub":"4.5 Proyeksi Skalar & Proyeksi Vektor Ortogonal","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika proyeksi vektor a pada b adalah p = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">2</span><span class=\"de\">3</span></span>b dan |b| = 6, maka nilai dari a · b adalah…","options":["12","18","24","4"],"key":[2],"why":"Rumus proyeksi vektor adalah <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">a · b</span><span class=\"de\">|b|²</span></span> b = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">2</span><span class=\"de\">3</span></span> b ⇒ <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">a · b</span><span class=\"de\">36</span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">2</span><span class=\"de\">3</span></span> ⇒ a · b = 24.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"4.0.0","topic":"Lingkaran & Transformasi","sub":"5.1 Persamaan Lingkaran & Kedudukan Titik–Garis","kind":"pg","stem":"Jari-jari lingkaran x² + y² + 8x − 2y + 8 = 0 adalah…","options":["4","9","2","3"],"key":[3],"why":"Pusat (−4, 1). Jari-jari r = √((−4)² + 1² − 8) = √(16 + 1 − 8) = √9 = 3.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"4.0.1","topic":"Lingkaran & Transformasi","sub":"5.1 Persamaan Lingkaran & Kedudukan Titik–Garis","kind":"pg","stem":"Kedudukan titik T(1, 2) terhadap lingkaran (x + 2)² + (y − 1)² = 9 adalah…","options":["di pusat lingkaran","di luar lingkaran","pada lingkaran","di dalam lingkaran"],"key":[1],"why":"Substitusi T(1, 2): K = (1+2)² + (2−1)² − 9 = 9 + 1 − 9 = 1 > 0. Karena K > 0, titik berada di luar lingkaran.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"4.0.2","topic":"Lingkaran & Transformasi","sub":"5.1 Persamaan Lingkaran & Kedudukan Titik–Garis","kind":"pg","stem":"Persamaan lingkaran yang berpusat di (3, −2) dan menyinggung sumbu-X adalah…","options":["(x − 3)² + (y + 2)² = 4","(x − 3)² + (y + 2)² = 2","(x − 3)² + (y + 2)² = 9","(x + 3)² + (y − 2)² = 4"],"key":[0],"why":"Menyinggung sumbu-X berarti jari-jari r = |b| = |−2| = 2, sehingga r² = 4.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"4.0.3","topic":"Lingkaran & Transformasi","sub":"5.1 Persamaan Lingkaran & Kedudukan Titik–Garis","kind":"pg","stem":"Panjang garis singgung yang ditarik dari titik T(5, 4) ke lingkaran x² + y² = 16 adalah…","options":["5","3","√41","4"],"key":[0],"why":"Kuasa titik K = 5² + 4² − 16 = 25 + 16 − 16 = 25. Panjang garis singgungnya = √K = √25 = 5.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"4.1.0","topic":"Lingkaran & Transformasi","sub":"5.2 Persamaan Garis Singgung Lingkaran (PGSL)","kind":"pg","stem":"Persamaan garis singgung lingkaran x² + y² = 13 di titik (−2, 3) adalah…","options":["2x − 3y = 13","−2x − 3y = 13","−2x + 3y = 13","3x − 2y = 13"],"key":[2],"why":"Titik (−2, 3) terletak pada lingkaran karena (−2)² + 3² = 13. Bagi adil: x₁x + y₁y = r² ⇒ −2x + 3y = 13.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"4.1.1","topic":"Lingkaran & Transformasi","sub":"5.2 Persamaan Garis Singgung Lingkaran (PGSL)","kind":"pg","stem":"Salah satu persamaan garis singgung lingkaran x² + y² = 9 yang sejajar garis y = 2x + 7 adalah…","options":["y = 2x + 9√5","y = 2x + 3√5","y = 2x + 3","y = −<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">1</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span>x + 3√5"],"key":[1],"why":"Sejajar berarti m = 2. Rumus: y = mx ± r√(1 + m²) = 2x ± 3√(1 + 4) = 2x ± 3√5.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"4.1.2","topic":"Lingkaran & Transformasi","sub":"5.2 Persamaan Garis Singgung Lingkaran (PGSL)","kind":"pg","stem":"Persamaan garis singgung lingkaran x² + y² − 6x + 2y − 15 = 0 di titik (7, 2) adalah…","options":["4x + 3y − 34 = 0","4x − 3y − 22 = 0","3x + 4y − 29 = 0","7x + 2y − 15 = 0"],"key":[0],"why":"Pusat P(3, −1). Bagi adil: (7−3)(x−3) + (2+1)(y+1) = 25 ⇒ 4x − 12 + 3y + 3 = 25 ⇒ 4x + 3y − 34 = 0.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"4.1.3","topic":"Lingkaran & Transformasi","sub":"5.2 Persamaan Garis Singgung Lingkaran (PGSL)","kind":"pg","stem":"Garis singgung lingkaran x² + y² = 25 yang tegak lurus garis 3x − 4y + 5 = 0 memiliki gradien m sebesar…","options":["<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">3</span><span class=\"de\">4</span></span>","−<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">3</span><span class=\"de\">4</span></span>","−<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">4</span><span class=\"de\">3</span></span>","<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">4</span><span class=\"de\">3</span></span>"],"key":[2],"why":"Gradien garis awal m₁ = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">3</span><span class=\"de\">4</span></span>. Karena tegak lurus, m₂ = −<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">1</span><span class=\"de\">m₁</span></span> = −<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">4</span><span class=\"de\">3</span></span>.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"4.2.0","topic":"Lingkaran & Transformasi","sub":"5.3 Busur, Juring & Tembereng Lingkaran","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika jari-jari lingkaran 10 cm dan sudut pusat juring 1,2 radian, maka luas juring tersebut adalah…","options":["240 cm²","120 cm²","60 cm²","12 cm²"],"key":[2],"why":"Dalam radian, L<sub>juring</sub> = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">1</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span> r² θ = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">1</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span> × 10² × 1,2 = 60 cm².","src":"kuis"},{"id":"4.2.1","topic":"Lingkaran & Transformasi","sub":"5.3 Busur, Juring & Tembereng Lingkaran","kind":"pg","stem":"Keliling daerah juring berjari-jari 7 cm dengan sudut pusat 180° adalah… (π = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">22</span><span class=\"de\">7</span></span>)","options":["29 cm","36 cm","22 cm","44 cm"],"key":[1],"why":"Keliling juring = panjang busur + 2r = (<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">180°</span><span class=\"de\">360°</span></span> × 2 × <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">22</span><span class=\"de\">7</span></span> × 7) + 2(7) = 22 + 14 = 36 cm.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"4.2.2","topic":"Lingkaran & Transformasi","sub":"5.3 Busur, Juring & Tembereng Lingkaran","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika panjang busur suatu juring adalah 15 cm dan jari-jari lingkarannya 8 cm, maka luas juring tersebut adalah…","options":["120 cm²","240 cm²","60 cm²","30 cm²"],"key":[2],"why":"Gunakan hubungan L<sub>juring</sub> = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">1</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span> · s · r = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">1</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span> × 15 × 8 = 60 cm².","src":"kuis"},{"id":"4.2.3","topic":"Lingkaran & Transformasi","sub":"5.3 Busur, Juring & Tembereng Lingkaran","kind":"pg","stem":"Pada lingkaran berjari-jari 10 cm, panjang tali busur untuk sudut pusat 90° adalah…","options":["10 cm","10√2 cm","10√3 cm","20 cm"],"key":[1],"why":"Segitiga siku-siku sama kaki dengan sisi 10 cm memiliki sisi miring (tali busur) 10√2 cm.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"4.3.0","topic":"Lingkaran & Transformasi","sub":"5.4 Translasi, Refleksi, Rotasi & Dilatasi","kind":"pg","stem":"Bayangan titik A(3, −5) oleh rotasi R[O, 90°] berlawanan arah jarum jam adalah…","options":["(5, 3)","(5, −3)","(−5, −3)","(−3, 5)"],"key":[0],"why":"Rotasi [O, 90°] memetakan (x, y) → (−y, x), sehingga (3, −5) → (−(−5), 3) = (5, 3).","src":"kuis"},{"id":"4.3.1","topic":"Lingkaran & Transformasi","sub":"5.4 Translasi, Refleksi, Rotasi & Dilatasi","kind":"pg","stem":"Pusat lingkaran (x − 2)² + (y + 1)² = 9 ditranslasikan oleh T(a, b) sehingga berpindah ke (−1, 4). Vektor translasi T adalah…","options":["(1, 3)","(−3, 5)","(3, −5)","(−3, 3)"],"key":[1],"why":"Pusat awal P(2, −1) dan pusat akhir P′(−1, 4). Maka T = P′ − P = (−1 − 2, 4 − (−1)) = (−3, 5).","src":"kuis"},{"id":"4.3.2","topic":"Lingkaran & Transformasi","sub":"5.4 Translasi, Refleksi, Rotasi & Dilatasi","kind":"pg","stem":"Bayangan titik P(−2, 5) oleh pencerminan terhadap garis y = −x adalah…","options":["(5, −2)","(−5, 2)","(2, −5)","(−2, −5)"],"key":[1],"why":"Refleksi terhadap y = −x memetakan (x, y) → (−y, −x), sehingga (−2, 5) → (−5, 2).","src":"kuis"},{"id":"4.3.3","topic":"Lingkaran & Transformasi","sub":"5.4 Translasi, Refleksi, Rotasi & Dilatasi","kind":"pg","stem":"Bayangan kurva parabola y = x² setelah digeser oleh translasi T = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>−4</td></tr></table></span> adalah…","options":["y = x² − 3x − 4","y = (x − 3)² + 4","y = (x + 3)² − 4","y = (x − 3)² − 4"],"key":[3],"why":"Ganti x dengan (x − 3) dan y dengan (y + 4): y + 4 = (x − 3)² ⇒ y = (x − 3)² − 4.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"4.4.0","topic":"Lingkaran & Transformasi","sub":"5.5 Matriks Transformasi, Komposisi & Luas Bayangan","kind":"pg","stem":"Transformasi T₁ dilanjutkan T₂ ditulis sebagai komposisi…","options":["T₁ + T₂","T₁ ∘ T₂ dengan matriks M₁M₂","T₂ ∘ T₁ dengan matriks M₁M₂","T₂ ∘ T₁ dengan matriks M₂M₁"],"key":[3],"why":"Titik X dipetakan dulu oleh M₁ menjadi M₁X, lalu oleh M₂ menjadi M₂(M₁X) = (M₂M₁)X.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"4.4.1","topic":"Lingkaran & Transformasi","sub":"5.5 Matriks Transformasi, Komposisi & Luas Bayangan","kind":"pg","stem":"Bangun datar seluas 10 cm² didilatasikan dengan faktor skala k = −3. Luas bayangannya adalah…","options":["90 cm²","30 cm²","−90 cm²","−30 cm²"],"key":[0],"why":"Luas bayangan dilatasi adalah L′ = k² · L<sub>awal</sub> = (−3)² × 10 = 90 cm².","src":"kuis"},{"id":"4.4.2","topic":"Lingkaran & Transformasi","sub":"5.5 Matriks Transformasi, Komposisi & Luas Bayangan","kind":"pg","stem":"Matriks tunggal yang mewakili rotasi R[O, 90°] dilanjutkan refleksi terhadap sumbu-Y adalah…","options":["<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>1</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>0</td><td>−1</td></tr></table></span>","<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>−1</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>0</td><td>1</td></tr></table></span>","<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>0</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>0</td></tr></table></span>","<span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>0</td><td>−1</td></tr><tr><td>−1</td><td>0</td></tr></table></span>"],"key":[2],"why":"M = M<sub>refY</sub> · M<sub>rot90</sub> = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>−1</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>0</td><td>1</td></tr></table></span><span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>0</td><td>−1</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>0</td></tr></table></span> = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>0</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>0</td></tr></table></span> (sama dengan refleksi terhadap y = x).","src":"kuis"},{"id":"4.4.3","topic":"Lingkaran & Transformasi","sub":"5.5 Matriks Transformasi, Komposisi & Luas Bayangan","kind":"pg","stem":"Jajargenjang dengan luas 15 satuan luas ditransformasikan oleh matriks <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>4</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>2</td></tr></table></span>. Luas bayangannya adalah…","options":["45","120","90","60"],"key":[2],"why":"det(M) = 4(2) − 2(1) = 6. Luas bayangan L′ = |6| × 15 = 90 satuan luas.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"5.0.0","topic":"Limit Fungsi","sub":"6.1 Limit Fungsi Aljabar (x → c)","kind":"pg","stem":"Nilai dari lim<sub>x→2</sub> <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">x³ − 8</span><span class=\"de\">x² − 4</span></span> adalah…","options":["0","3","4","2"],"key":[1],"why":"Faktorkan: <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">(x−2)(x²+2x+4)</span><span class=\"de\">(x−2)(x+2)</span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">4+4+4</span><span class=\"de\">4</span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">12</span><span class=\"de\">4</span></span> = 3 (atau dengan L'Hôpital: <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">3x²</span><span class=\"de\">2x</span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">3(4)</span><span class=\"de\">4</span></span> = 3).","src":"kuis"},{"id":"5.0.1","topic":"Limit Fungsi","sub":"6.1 Limit Fungsi Aljabar (x → c)","kind":"pg","stem":"Nilai dari lim<sub>x→4</sub> <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">√(2x + 1) − 3</span><span class=\"de\">x − 4</span></span> adalah…","options":["1","<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">1</span><span class=\"de\">6</span></span>","<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">2</span><span class=\"de\">3</span></span>","<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">1</span><span class=\"de\">3</span></span>"],"key":[3],"why":"Kalikan sekawan: <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">2x + 1 − 9</span><span class=\"de\">(x − 4)(√(2x + 1) + 3)</span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">2</span><span class=\"de\">3 + 3</span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">2</span><span class=\"de\">6</span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">1</span><span class=\"de\">3</span></span>.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"5.0.2","topic":"Limit Fungsi","sub":"6.1 Limit Fungsi Aljabar (x → c)","kind":"pg","stem":"Nilai dari lim<sub>x→1</sub> <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">x² + 2x − 3</span><span class=\"de\">2x − 2</span></span> adalah…","options":["2","1","3","4"],"key":[0],"why":"Faktorkan: <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">(x − 1)(x + 3)</span><span class=\"de\">2(x − 1)</span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">1 + 3</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span> = 2.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"5.0.3","topic":"Limit Fungsi","sub":"6.1 Limit Fungsi Aljabar (x → c)","kind":"pg","stem":"Jika lim<sub>x→3</sub> <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">f(x) − 5</span><span class=\"de\">x − 3</span></span> = 4 dan f(x) kontinu, maka nilai f(3) adalah…","options":["3","0","4","5"],"key":[3],"why":"Agar bentuknya <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">0</span><span class=\"de\">0</span></span> saat penyebut 3 − 3 = 0, pembilang wajib bernilai 0: f(3) − 5 = 0 ⇒ f(3) = 5.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"5.1.0","topic":"Limit Fungsi","sub":"6.2 Limit Menuju Tak Hingga (x → ∞)","kind":"pg","stem":"Nilai dari lim<sub>x→∞</sub> <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">6x³ − 2x + 1</span><span class=\"de\">2x³ + 5x² − 3</span></span> adalah…","options":["−<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">2</span><span class=\"de\">5</span></span>","3","∞","0"],"key":[1],"why":"Derajat pembilang dan penyebut sama (derajat 3), sehingga nilai limit adalah rasio koefisien pangkat tertinggi: <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">6</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span> = 3.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"5.1.1","topic":"Limit Fungsi","sub":"6.2 Limit Menuju Tak Hingga (x → ∞)","kind":"pg","stem":"Nilai dari lim<sub>x→∞</sub> (√(9x² + 6x + 1) − √(9x² − 12x + 5)) adalah…","options":["1","2","3","−1"],"key":[2],"why":"Karena a = p = 9, gunakan <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">b − q</span><span class=\"de\">2√a</span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">6 − (−12)</span><span class=\"de\">2√9</span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">18</span><span class=\"de\">6</span></span> = 3.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"5.1.2","topic":"Limit Fungsi","sub":"6.2 Limit Menuju Tak Hingga (x → ∞)","kind":"pg","stem":"Nilai dari lim<sub>x→∞</sub> (x + 4 − √(x² − 2x + 9)) adalah…","options":["2","5","6","3"],"key":[1],"why":"Tulis x + 4 = √((x + 4)²) = √(x² + 8x + 16). Maka L = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">8 − (−2)</span><span class=\"de\">2√1</span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">10</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span> = 5.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"5.1.3","topic":"Limit Fungsi","sub":"6.2 Limit Menuju Tak Hingga (x → ∞)","kind":"pg","stem":"Nilai dari lim<sub>x→∞</sub> <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">5x² − 100x + 999</span><span class=\"de\">x³ + 1</span></span> adalah…","options":["−100","5","0","∞"],"key":[2],"why":"Karena derajat pembilang (2) lebih kecil dari derajat penyebut (3), nilai limitnya menuju 0.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"5.2.0","topic":"Limit Fungsi","sub":"6.3 Limit Fungsi Trigonometri","kind":"pg","stem":"Nilai dari lim<sub>x→0</sub> <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">sin 6x + tan 2x</span><span class=\"de\">4x</span></span> adalah…","options":["2","4","1","3"],"key":[0],"why":"Bagi masing-masing suku dengan 4x: <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">6</span><span class=\"de\">4</span></span> + <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">2</span><span class=\"de\">4</span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">8</span><span class=\"de\">4</span></span> = 2.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"5.2.1","topic":"Limit Fungsi","sub":"6.3 Limit Fungsi Trigonometri","kind":"pg","stem":"Nilai dari lim<sub>x→0</sub> <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">cos 2x − 1</span><span class=\"de\">x²</span></span> adalah…","options":["−2","2","1","−1"],"key":[0],"why":"cos 2x − 1 = −(1 − cos 2x) = −2 sin²(x). Maka limitnya menjadi −2 · (1)² = −2.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"5.2.2","topic":"Limit Fungsi","sub":"6.3 Limit Fungsi Trigonometri","kind":"pg","stem":"Nilai dari lim<sub>x→0</sub> <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">tan 5x − sin 5x</span><span class=\"de\">x³</span></span> adalah…","options":["<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">25</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span>","5","<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">125</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span>","0"],"key":[2],"why":"tan 5x − sin 5x = tan 5x (1 − cos 5x) = tan 5x · 2 sin²(<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">5</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span>x). Dibagi x³ menghasilkan 5 × 2 × (<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">5</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span>)² = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">125</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span>.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"5.2.3","topic":"Limit Fungsi","sub":"6.3 Limit Fungsi Trigonometri","kind":"pg","stem":"Nilai dari lim<sub>x→0</sub> <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">cos 4x − cos 2x</span><span class=\"de\">x²</span></span> adalah…","options":["−6","3","−3","6"],"key":[0],"why":"Gunakan <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">1 − cos 2x</span><span class=\"de\">x²</span></span> − <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">1 − cos 4x</span><span class=\"de\">x²</span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">2²</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span> − <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">4²</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span> = 2 − 8 = −6.","src":"kuis"},{"id":"hots-h1","topic":"Matriks","sub":"HOTS · Invers & Determinan Matriks Berpangkat","kind":"pg","title":"Invers & Determinan Matriks Berpangkat","stem":"Diketahui matriks A = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>2</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>3</td></tr></table></span> dan matriks B berordo 2×2 memenuhi persamaan A · B = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>4</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>4</td></tr></table></span>. Nilai dari det(2 · B⁻¹) adalah…","options":["<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">2</span><span class=\"de\">5</span></span>","5","<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">1</span><span class=\"de\">5</span></span>","<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">4</span><span class=\"de\">5</span></span>"],"key":[3],"why":"Hitung det(A) = 2(3) − 1(4) = 2 dan det(AB) = 4(4) − 2(3) = 10. Dari sifat determinan det(AB) = det(A)·det(B) ⇒ 10 = 2·det(B) ⇒ det(B) = 5. Maka det(B⁻¹) = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">1</span><span class=\"de\">5</span></span>. Karena B⁻¹ berordo 2×2, berlaku det(2·B⁻¹) = 2² · det(B⁻¹) = 4 × (<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">1</span><span class=\"de\">5</span></span>) = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">4</span><span class=\"de\">5</span></span>. Jebakan utama: lupa mengkuadratkan skalar 2 pada matriks 2×2!","src":"hots"},{"id":"hots-h2","topic":"Polinomial","sub":"HOTS · Kongruensi Polinomial Orde 4","kind":"pg","title":"Kongruensi Polinomial Orde 4","stem":"Suku banyak f(x) = x⁴ + ax³ + bx² − x + 2 habis dibagi oleh (x² + x + 1). Nilai dari 2a + b adalah…","options":["2","−4","0","−2"],"key":[1],"why":"Karena (x − 1)(x² + x + 1) = x³ − 1, untuk pembuat nol pembagi x² + x + 1 = 0 berlaku x³ ≡ 1 dan x² ≡ −x − 1. Substitusikan ke f(x): x·(x³) + a(x³) + b(−x − 1) − x + 2 = x(1) + a(1) − bx − b − x + 2 = (−b)x + (a − b + 2). Agar habis dibagi, sisa harus 0x + 0: −b = 0 ⇒ b = 0, dan a − 0 + 2 = 0 ⇒ a = −2. Maka 2a + b = 2(−2) + 0 = −4.","src":"hots"},{"id":"hots-h3","topic":"Fungsi Lanjut","sub":"HOTS · Daerah Hasil Fungsi Komposisi Eksponen-Kuadrat","kind":"pg","title":"Daerah Hasil Fungsi Komposisi Eksponen-Kuadrat","stem":"Diketahui fungsi f(x) = 2<sup>x² − 4x + 5</sup> − 3 untuk setiap x ∈ ℝ. Daerah hasil (range) dari fungsi f(x) adalah…","options":["[−3, ∞)","(−3, ∞)","[2, ∞)","[−1, ∞)"],"key":[3],"why":"Lengkapi kuadrat sempurna pada pangkatnya: g(x) = x² − 4x + 5 = (x − 2)² + 1. Karena (x − 2)² ≥ 0 untuk semua x ∈ ℝ, maka nilai minimum pangkatnya adalah 1 (tercapai saat x = 2). Karena basis 2 > 1, nilai minimum 2<sup>g(x</sup>) adalah 2¹ = 2. Maka f(x) ≥ 2 − 3 = −1, sehingga daerah hasilnya adalah [−1, ∞) dengan kurung siku karena nilai −1 benar-benar tercapai di x = 2!","src":"hots"},{"id":"hots-h4","topic":"Vektor","sub":"HOTS · Parameter Vektor Ruang & Sudut Ortogonal","kind":"pg","title":"Parameter Vektor Ruang & Sudut Ortogonal","stem":"Diketahui vektor u = (m, 2, −1) dan v = (m, −m, 2). Jika vektor u saling tegak lurus terhadap vektor v (u ⊥ v), maka jumlah semua nilai m real yang memenuhi adalah…","options":["0","−2","2","1"],"key":[2],"why":"Syarat u ⊥ v adalah u · v = 0 ⇒ m(m) + 2(−m) + (−1)(2) = 0 ⇒ m² − 2m − 2 = 0. Karena diskriminan D = 4 − 4(1)(−2) = 12 > 0, kedua akar m₁ dan m₂ real. Jumlah semua nilai m menurut rumus Vieta adalah m₁ + m₂ = −<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">b</span><span class=\"de\">a</span></span> = −<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">−2</span><span class=\"de\">1</span></span> = 2.","src":"hots"},{"id":"hots-h5","topic":"Lingkaran & Transformasi","sub":"HOTS · Komposisi Transformasi pada Lingkaran","kind":"pg","title":"Komposisi Transformasi pada Lingkaran","stem":"Lingkaran L: (x − 1)² + (y + 2)² = 4 ditransformasikan oleh matriks M = <span class=\"mtx\"><table><tr><td>0</td><td>−2</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>0</td></tr></table></span>. Luas daerah lingkaran bayangan L′ adalah…","options":["4π","64π","16π","8π"],"key":[2],"why":"Lingkaran awal memiliki jari-jari r = 2, sehingga luas awalnya L<sub>awal</sub> = πr² = 4π. Determinan matriks transformasi M adalah det(M) = 0(0) − (−2)(2) = 4. Maka luas bayangan adalah L′ = |det(M)| × L<sub>awal</sub> = 4 × 4π = 16π.","src":"hots"},{"id":"hots-h6","topic":"Limit Fungsi","sub":"HOTS · Limit Trigonometri Bentuk Akar Sekawan","kind":"pg","title":"Limit Trigonometri Bentuk Akar Sekawan","stem":"Nilai dari lim<sub>x→0</sub> <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">1 − cos 2x</span><span class=\"de\">x · (√(1 + x) − √(1 − x))</span></span> adalah…","options":["4","2","1","0"],"key":[1],"why":"Kalikan pembilang dan penyebut dengan sekawan akar (√(1+x) + √(1−x)): penyebut menjadi x · [(1+x) − (1−x)] = x · (2x) = 2x². Sementara itu 1 − cos 2x = 2 sin²(x). Maka limit menjadi lim<sub>x→0</sub> <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">2 sin²(x) · (√(1+x) + √(1−x))</span><span class=\"de\">2x²</span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"nu\">2</span><span class=\"de\">2</span></span> × 1² × (1 + 1) = 2.","src":"hots"}]};
